# 🚀 Azure ARM Template Project

## Windows VM Deployment with Custom Script Extension (IIS)

------------------------------------------------------------------------

## 📌 Project Overview

This project provisions a complete **Windows Virtual Machine
infrastructure in Microsoft Azure** using **ARM (Azure Resource Manager)
Templates**.

All resources are created from scratch using Infrastructure as Code
(IaC).

------------------------------------------------------------------------

## 🏗 Deployment Flow Chart

    Start
      │
      ▼
    Create Resource Group
      │
      ▼
    Deploy ARM Template
      │
      ├── Create Virtual Network (VNet)
      │       └── Create Subnet
      │
      ├── Create Network Security Group (Allow 80 & 3389)
      │
      ├── Create Public IP (Static)
      │
      ├── Create Network Interface (NIC)
      │       └── Attach NSG + Public IP + Subnet
      │
      ├── Create Windows VM
      │       ├── Create OS Disk
      │       └── (Optional) Attach Data Disk
      │
      └── Install IIS via Custom Script Extension
               │
               ▼
            Website Accessible via Public IP

------------------------------------------------------------------------

## 🏗 What This Template Creates

-   Virtual Network (VNet)
-   Subnet
-   Network Security Group (NSG)
-   Public IP Address
-   Network Interface (NIC)
-   Windows Server 2022 VM
-   OS Disk
